  - chapterNumber: 0
    pageType: 2
    title: Cero
    description: Nice to meet you visitor! I'm Cero the Great Blue Heron!
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8535b9a16c1a40399ccbccb86b0c62b, type: 3}
