  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 1
    title: Ripple the Red-Legged Frog
    description: 'Scientific Name: Rana draytonii'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0768d2850e753496199ff16ff8e10805, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 2
    title: Ripple
    description: Hello visitor! I'm Ripple the red-legged frog.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0768d2850e753496199ff16ff8e10805, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 2
    title: Ripple
    description: "Thank goodness you\u2019re here! There\u2019s been so much chaos
      at the SLO creek, and I could use your help."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0768d2850e753496199ff16ff8e10805, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 2
    title: Ripple
    description: "Can you talk to the bullfrog and see what he\u2019s up to? I think
      he\u2019s causing trouble..."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0768d2850e753496199ff16ff8e10805, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 3
    title: 
    description: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn:
    - prefab: {fileID: 70031088}
      localPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      localRotation: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      localScale: {x: 0.01, y: 0.01, z: 0.01}
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 1
    title: American Bullfrog
    description: 'Scientific Name: Lithobates catesbeianus'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b2f18edcaf4819bcebd9f73e8df70, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 2
    title: American Bullfrog
    description: "Ribbit ribbit.... I\u2019m feeling hungry..."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e48b2f18edcaf4819bcebd9f73e8df70, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
    pageType: 2
    title: Ripple
    description: "Watch out! He\u2019ll eat anything he can fit in his mouth! He\u2019s
      been causing chaos all around the creek community."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0768d2850e753496199ff16ff8e10805, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 1
