  - chapterNumber: 3
    pageType: 2
    title: "Crotch\u2019s Bumble Bee"
    description: I like this plant for its nectar and pollen! Thank you!
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ae5160b7358d04561991d378d5f20f3a, type: 3}
