  - chapterNumber: 3
    pageType: 2
    title: Mariposa
    description: "My other friend, Anna\u2019s Hummingbird, also likes milkweed too.
      Show her the Narrowleaf Milkweed!"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8ee8fea619ada40e1a3648a542479384, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
