  - chapterNumber: 3
    pageType: 1
    title: "Anna the Anna\u2019s Hummingbird"
    description: 'Scientific Name: Calypte anna'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a43baffc3c5a64fd5b69f21812eba1ff, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: Local
    label2: Native
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 3
    pageType: 2
    title: "Anna\u2019s Hummingbird"
    description: This milkweed is so yummy! Thank you!
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a43baffc3c5a64fd5b69f21812eba1ff, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 3
    pageType: 2
    title: Mariposa
    description: Wow! Look how beautiful the creek looks. You can also plant certain
      types of milkweed in your backyard too! Check the field journal for details
      on each plant.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8ee8fea619ada40e1a3648a542479384, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 3
    title: 
    description: 
    image: {fileID: 0}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn:
    - prefab: {fileID: 3410784497459952717, guid: 7bf6d27b838a54cad9127a3dbe927336, type: 3}
      localPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      localRotation: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
      localScale: {x: 0.01, y: 0.01, z: 0.01}
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 1
    title: Bingo the Belted Kingfisher
    description: 'Scientific Name: Megaceryle alcyon'
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: Local
    label2: Native
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "Hello! I\u2019m Bingo, the Belted Kingfisher!"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "I\u2019m a top predator around here! I use my keen eyesight and
      diving abilities to hunt fish and other small creatures in the creek."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "I\u2019m looking for the perfect riverside branch to hunt for some
      minnows, use these binoculars to help me find it!"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: Thanks, this branch is perfect! Fremont Cottonwoods grow directly
      over the creek, giving me a high point to spot fish below before diving in!
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: Now I need to find something to eat... can you spot a minnow for
      me?
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: Amazing! California Roaches are one of my favorite snacks, a native
      type of minnow that I feed on along with other small fish.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 1
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "Now, I\u2019ll hover over the water and wait for the perfect moment
      to dive headfirst and hunt the California Roach..."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "I got it! That was yummy! I\u2019m full now, guess it\u2019s time
      to go back to my nesting tunnel and rest...."
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: Instead of high up in a tree, my tunnel is on the banks near the
      water. Bird nests can come in all shapes and forms!
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
  - chapterNumber: 4
    pageType: 2
    title: Bingo
    description: "Thanks for your help! Using my bill and claws, I\u2019ll dig my
      nesting burrow. I can dig almost 15 feet into the bank!"
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d8d25b0401174b859ffa351c6dca9e2, type: 3}
    hideButton: 0
    label1: 
    label2: 
    objectsToSpawn: []
